<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-30T20:57:04.558Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 20:57:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan resumed airstrikes in southern Syria against Daesh, prompting Syrian condemnation and reports of civilian casualties. Syrian security forces killed a French jihadist in Harem and another French fighter in Idlib, while unidentified gunmen killed two Syrian defence ministry personnel in Idlib. Flash floods across Syria killed five people, including four children, and injured several others. Syria announced the release of 57 prisoners transferred from Lebanon. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOSjltRzVfcTZCajZXemFtZzRndG9BM2tpZ0Y2UnhaeENKZXp6WGQxRERjeThUTUtxRDR6TE1IZlozSGFHRDlJNmZNNi1tVjhoU3g5VG4zQlFvc3R3OERRbGZFU3VPN2dXSHRldERvTVh4LWZDZERVdW9tdlYwNnVWd3ZibkIwdjZMcGFBcXIwR21VX2I0b3RhSU1aUUJfZEZtbDVjWUhZZUNzM0ho?oc=5&quot;&gt;FDD's Long War Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxOUGF5MzEweVl3U2lveTRjQl9MUkRsenZUQmlOTTFZNGpnTDBZcG9tVGlyRTVJRkxmNTF3dFBab3NjU3JfYVRlNjBKOTNENmM4SEstT3N5Z3JyRHd5X3kyOGZoT3ZpcDI3cVFCTG1jTWlialdQMW1LelI5STVYbkI0WQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTEFVX3lxTFA2bWNBbnF5RlJkN2JGbjVwNnJ3cTFNdGE0V0swSklCRzNUUWg2WmRwMzZhX1ZnMWNHWHk4WnVFYUU3QWpXUEw1cDM1VjE?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPT25GYlplT0VFYWZXZ0lndTJINHg4R3d3cDJFZTVucE1fY2pNeXRvUko3c2ZYNmcwellIb2dTZmFGYXZtRUotTnFJU1ZtME9yMmlCdGItTV9PRE0xTDl5ejhXTWJNTFE1SXY5TzJfVUk4UG4wY3lhWTdkVlJpVDZRN2hicnh4b3h5d2Q3TzBoN3ZxRExvYjVYVmE3aktlTmRtNkJSSXY0UGVSNGpEakpWdmJfcXRldTV0d3hXN3plcFAyX1RR?oc=5&q